            <desc_content>
                <paragraph>A class that can be modified to customize the behavior of <reference internal="1" reftitle="hydra_zen.builds" refuri="hydra_zen.builds#hydra_zen.builds"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">builds</literal></reference>, <reference internal="1" reftitle="hydra_zen.just" refuri="hydra_zen.just#hydra_zen.just"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">just</literal></reference>, <reference internal="1" reftitle="hydra_zen.kwargs_of" refuri="hydra_zen.kwargs_of#hydra_zen.kwargs_of"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">kwargs_of</literal></reference>, and <reference internal="1" reftitle="hydra_zen.make_config" refuri="hydra_zen.make_config#hydra_zen.make_config"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">make_config</literal></reference>.</paragraph>
                <paragraph>These functions are exposed as class methods of <reference internal="1" refid="hydra_zen.BuildsFn" reftitle="hydra_zen.BuildsFn"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">BuildsFn</literal></reference>.</paragraph>
                <bullet_list bullet="-">
                    <list_item>
                        <paragraph>To customize type-refinement support, override <reference internal="1" refid="hydra_zen.BuildsFn._sanitized_type" reftitle="hydra_zen.BuildsFn._sanitized_type"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">_sanitized_type</literal></reference>.</paragraph>
                    </list_item>
                    <list_item>
                        <paragraph>To customize auto-config support, override <reference internal="1" refid="hydra_zen.BuildsFn._make_hydra_compatible" reftitle="hydra_zen.BuildsFn._make_hydra_compatible"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">_make_hydra_compatible</literal></reference>.</paragraph>
                    </list_item>
                    <list_item>
                        <paragraph>To customize the ability to resolve import paths, override <reference internal="1" refid="hydra_zen.BuildsFn._get_obj_path" reftitle="hydra_zen.BuildsFn._get_obj_path"><literal classes="xref py py-obj">_get_obj_path</literal></reference>.</paragraph>
                    </list_item>
                </bullet_list>
